{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 31690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28620, "text": "I had a shrub for breakfast."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 38030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35900, "text": "Hi, guys. Sorry I'm late."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 41760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38200, "text": "- Bull, how about calling the court to order?"}
