{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 188980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 186580, "text": "...that we put her"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 188980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 186580, "text": "in the staff Christmas picture."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 194650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192520, "text": "No, it can't be."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 198590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194820, "text": "Well, somebody give me $50"}
