{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 200090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198760, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 205030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 200260, "text": "I am just kidding."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 205030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 200260, "text": "Twenty-five would probably do it."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 209830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 205200, "text": "- I could call Brooklyn and get her file."}
