{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 213900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 212710, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 216410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214080, "text": "- Put a rush on it, huh?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 216410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214080, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 220780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219150, "text": "That's lunch, everybody."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 224050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221150, "text": "Sir, uh,"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 224050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221150, "text": "could Florence take this prisoner?"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 226650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224220, "text": "I need to run down to the bank"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 226650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224220, "text": "and cash in my IRA."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 230550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226820, "text": "I got my eye on a little snowblower"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 230550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226820, "text": "I think Renee's gonna flip over."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 233700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230730, "text": "Bull, your IRA's for your retirement."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 237890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233860, "text": "Oh, I'll probably be killed in a prison break"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 237890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233860, "text": "long before that."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 242900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238070, "text": "Imagine the neck muscles you need"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 242900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238070, "text": "to hold up that much granite."}
