{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 245540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243070, "text": "- Sure, Bull, go ahead."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 250440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247210, "text": "There he spends."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 252270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251180, "text": "You let him go?"}
