{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 257880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255750, "text": "Come on, Miss Sullivan,"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 257880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255750, "text": "we're not sure she's--"}
