{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 292950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289280, "text": "about the tooth fairy."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 296250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293660, "text": "Like to rip my lips off."}
