{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 309430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306840, "text": "- Oh."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 313900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310370, "text": "Bull, what can I say?"}
