{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 368460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365030, "text": "But I've been doing more research."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 375130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370170, "text": "And I think it just might be possible..."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 379430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375300, "text": "...if you don't mind taking a few risks."}
