{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 400490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398860, "text": "Hey, you okay?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 404390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400660, "text": "- Think I'm starting to hyperventilate."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 404390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400660, "text": "- Here, breathe into this."}
