{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 409200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405470, "text": "in there."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 424820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422450, "text": "- Oh, great."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 424820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422450, "text": "- Problem?"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 427680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424990, "text": "- I asked for whitewalls."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 427680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424990, "text": "- Oh."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 430720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428020, "text": "I thought maybe you wanted one"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 430720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428020, "text": "that folded out into a bed."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 437960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433430, "text": "Who in the hell are you?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 437960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433430, "text": "And where can I get that shade of dye?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 443260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440700, "text": "Look, Bull is a friend of mine..."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 445770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443440, "text": "...and I happen to care about him"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 445770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443440, "text": "very much."}
