{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 581730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580210, "text": "Why don't you just tell me?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 585910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583140, "text": "Bull, Renee is a...."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 591880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589580, "text": "She's an...."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 596350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592050, "text": "For God's sakes."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 596350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592050, "text": "Bull, the woman is a hooker."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 605860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 602830, "text": "We're gonna need a gross of pencils..."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 608060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606030, "text": "...three dozen typewriter ribbons--"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 616370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613340, "text": "Six pints of whole blood...."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 627620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625750, "text": "Here's your coffee, sir."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 629160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627790, "text": "Bull's still at it, huh?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 637450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634000, "text": "That was a major appliance, wasn't it?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 640930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639170, "text": "A.44-caliber."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 644540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641100, "text": "It won't stop him,"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 644540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641100, "text": "but it should slow him down."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 658850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654980, "text": "You needed new duct work anyway, sir."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 661290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659020, "text": "Oh, uh, I just got off the phone"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 661290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659020, "text": "with the hospital."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 663450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661460, "text": "They released Dan 20 minutes ago."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 667160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663860, "text": "- The big guy really nailed him, huh?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 667160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663860, "text": "- Well, Bull didn't really hit him."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 670960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667330, "text": "Dan flinched, fell backwards,"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 670960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667330, "text": "bounced off the wall, tripped over the rug..."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 674100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671130, "text": "...and dented Harry's refrigerator"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 674100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671130, "text": "with his back."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 686010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681640, "text": "So that's why"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 686010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681640, "text": "they call him Dr. Strangelove."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 691250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688850, "text": "- Dan, are you all right?"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 691250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688850, "text": "- I'm fine."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 696650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691420, "text": "I've got my friends, I've got my career,"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 696650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691420, "text": "and an unlimited mileage rate."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 706430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704270, "text": "All the fires are out."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 709500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707370, "text": "Say, that is good news."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 719010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716180, "text": "I figure 5000 should cover it."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 724510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721920, "text": "Oh, my dear God."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 725950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724690, "text": "Is it that bad?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 728880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726350, "text": "Did you see <i>The Day After?</i>"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 742960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740440, "text": "Oh, great. My battery's dead."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 747540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743140, "text": "I've got a date with the duchess"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 747540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743140, "text": "of discipline and my battery is dead."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 749180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747710, "text": "Christine, do me a favor..."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 752440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749340, "text": "...and push me over to that plug"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 752440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749340, "text": "so I can recharge this thing."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 754980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 752610, "text": "Sure, Dan."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 760880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756350, "text": "Heh, hey. You ever see Jon Voight"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 760880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756350, "text": "and Jane Fonda in <i>Coming Home?</i>"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 765050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761890, "text": "Did you ever see Richard Widmark"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 765050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761890, "text": "in <i>Kiss of Death?</i>"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 782300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778740, "text": "She, uh,"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 782300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778740, "text": "really ripped your heart out, huh?"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 786180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783850, "text": "You wanna talk about it?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 790780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787080, "text": "You will eventually,"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 790780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787080, "text": "and I'll be there for you."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 797320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795690, "text": "Fort Benning, Georgia."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 802450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797490, "text": "The 82nd Airborne Division"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 802450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797490, "text": "said to say hello."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 807930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806200, "text": "Hey, baby."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 810230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808100, "text": "I missed you."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 813330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811270, "text": "As much as all the other guys?"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 816280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813880, "text": "Come on,"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 816280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813880, "text": "you don't think there's another guy."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 822170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818680, "text": "Does the name John ring a bell?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 828110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825590, "text": "You sleep with men for money."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 832250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830190, "text": "So you figured it out."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 834760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832430, "text": "What are you gonna do?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 834760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832430, "text": "Sic your judge friend on me?"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 836830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834930, "text": "- Ugh, Renee--"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 836830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834930, "text": "- What is he gonna charge me with?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 839020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837000, "text": "Felony present-accepting?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 842330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 839200, "text": "Well, I'm not gonna give them back,"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 842330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 839200, "text": "because I already hocked them."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 845410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842500, "text": "- That's your business."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 845410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842500, "text": "- That's right, that is my business."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 848940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845570, "text": "My business is conning jerks like you."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 851910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850550, "text": "Goodbye, Renee."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 856280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854220, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 861620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857450, "text": "I took you to the cleaners."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 861620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857450, "text": "You've been had, big boy. Don't you get it?"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 866060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862290, "text": "- Yeah, I do get it."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 866060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862290, "text": "- Good."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 868750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866230, "text": "Then go ahead and hit me."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 868750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866230, "text": "Come on, I can take it."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 870920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868930, "text": "Go ahead. I've been hit before."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 873290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871770, "text": "I feel sorry for you."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 877540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874700, "text": "I said, hit me, bozo."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 880540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878070, "text": "I see people like you every day."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 884010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880710, "text": "They take and take"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 884010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880710, "text": "because they never fill up inside."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 886440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884180, "text": "Why don't you get angry with me?"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 889480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887180, "text": "- Oh, I'm angry, all right."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 889480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887180, "text": "- See?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 893010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889980, "text": "I'm angry at all those people"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 893010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889980, "text": "that hurt you..."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 895880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893190, "text": "...because they hurt you real bad."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 899660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896290, "text": "And it makes me sad"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 899660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896290, "text": "to think about the other Renee."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 902690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900090, "text": "The one that never had a chance."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 905360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903630, "text": "The one I fell in love with."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 910260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908770, "text": "Bye."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 914340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912670, "text": "That's it?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 916810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914510, "text": "Oh, yeah, I almost forgot."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 926180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924520, "text": "Happy anniversary."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 931150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928060, "text": "It would've been two weeks tonight."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 980900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979370, "text": "Sir."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 983980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981080, "text": "- What's that?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 983980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981080, "text": "- Your couch."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 992980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989520, "text": "I guess reupholstering"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 992980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989520, "text": "is out of the question, huh?"}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 994490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993150, "text": "Uh-huh."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 998480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995390, "text": "- You want the next case, sir?"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 998480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995390, "text": "- Bull, are you okay?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1003630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999190, "text": "Sir, life may be filled with pitfalls"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1003630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999190, "text": "and uncertainty..."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1006530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003800, "text": "...but from adversity comes strength."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1008300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006970, "text": "Who said that?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1011900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010040, "text": "It's me, sir."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1015230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013670, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1018640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016140, "text": "Holy cow."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1026620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021450, "text": "That is a bold fashion statement."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1043460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040400, "text": "Your Honor, may I address the court?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1046770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044040, "text": "- Listen, I-- I don't--"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1046770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044040, "text": "- I..."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1049200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048180, "text": "...am a hooker."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1050640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049380, "text": "Renee, don't."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1057150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050810, "text": "You see, I degrade myself for money"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1057150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050810, "text": "because I don't like myself very much."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1059250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057320, "text": "- Please."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1059250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057320, "text": "- No, that's--"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1061890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059420, "text": "That's not entirely true."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1065420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062760, "text": "I don't like myself at all."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1069290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067730, "text": "And this man..."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1074200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070900, "text": "...made me feel like a princess."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1079300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077470, "text": "Do you know why?"}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1083140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081010, "text": "You know why?"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1086780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084050, "text": "Well, I don't know why either."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1091510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1086950, "text": "Can somebody please tell me why?"}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1094020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091690, "text": "Okay, okay. It's gonna be okay."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1096050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094190, "text": "- Let's call it a night, Mac."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1096050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094190, "text": "- Right."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1099160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096220, "text": "- Uh, I'll get her some water."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1099160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096220, "text": "- Thank you, Flo."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1104590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102900, "text": "Everything under control, Bull?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1111670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107370, "text": "Right. I've been meaning to go in"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1111670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107370, "text": "for that brain scan."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1115700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113010, "text": "All right, folks, show's over."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1122310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118210, "text": "Why did she have to do this?"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1122310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118210, "text": "Now I feel sorry for her."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1124750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122480, "text": "Let's take her into my office."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1129620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127020, "text": "Maybe I'll get one for Christmas."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1134360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131390, "text": "Okay, now take a deep breath."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1139360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137630, "text": "Feel any better?"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1141590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139530, "text": "I feel dizzy and nauseous."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1145000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141770, "text": "Reality. Does that to you sometimes."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1149870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145410, "text": "I don't even know why"}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1149870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145410, "text": "I came here, but I knew I just had to."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1154070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150040, "text": "I think it had something to do"}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1154070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150040, "text": "with self-respect."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1158910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155380, "text": "You had an attack of dignity."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1162120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160920, "text": "Hopefully, it's chronic."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1167930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166060, "text": "Should we call a doctor?"}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1170060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168830, "text": "Good idea."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1171700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170230, "text": "- You hurt?"}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1171700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170230, "text": "- No."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1177130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171870, "text": "I would like somebody"}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1177130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171870, "text": "to take an x-ray of you..."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1179240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177300, "text": "...to tell me what you are."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1182610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179410, "text": "Because no man"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1182610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179410, "text": "can be that compassionate."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1185480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183040, "text": "You're wrong there, Renee."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1187810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185650, "text": "He's a man, all right."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1191150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187980, "text": "Admittedly, there aren't many around"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1191150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187980, "text": "who are as special as he is..."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1193120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191320, "text": "...but there are a few."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1198060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193290, "text": "And, if we're lucky,"}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1198060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193290, "text": "if we're very, very lucky..."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1201790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198230, "text": "...one crosses our path in a lifetime."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1205570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202700, "text": "Are we talking about the film <i>Gandhi?</i>"}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1211200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209670, "text": "Some of them are cute too."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1216000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213010, "text": "- Come on, now. Upsy-daisy."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1216000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213010, "text": "- I feel so embarrassed."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1218340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216180, "text": "Oh, forget it."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1220440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218710, "text": "You know something?"}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1223940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221350, "text": "It's not what other people think"}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1223940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221350, "text": "that counts."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1226710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224120, "text": "It's how we feel about ourselves."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1231150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228560, "text": "You make me feel beautiful."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1233790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231530, "text": "Yeah, well, red's your color."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1235990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233960, "text": "Ha, ha. It's not the dress."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1238960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236160, "text": "I know, but if I hear one more compliment,"}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1238960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236160, "text": "I think I'm gonna throw up."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1242670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240430, "text": "Hey, that reminds me, I'm hungry."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1248640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246040, "text": "- How about you?"}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1248640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246040, "text": "- Yeah, I could use a bite."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1253210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248810, "text": "Great. I know this quaint little"}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1253210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248810, "text": "all-you-can-eat liver joint down the block."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1257210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253950, "text": "If you'll be there,"}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1257210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253950, "text": "then it's gonna be wonderful."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1270300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267930, "text": "He is one special man."}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1272230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270460, "text": "Yeah, he is."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1275200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272400, "text": "Come on, I know a quaint little"}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1275200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272400, "text": "all-you-can-eat kelp bar..."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1277460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275370, "text": "...next to the liver joint."}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1282000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280980, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1286210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284580, "text": "It's time."}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1291850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289480, "text": "Sheila, ha, ha, about the wheelchair--"}
{"cue": 390, "end_ms": 1293320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292020, "text": "Shh."}
{"cue": 391, "end_ms": 1295550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293490, "text": "You're talking again, Dan."}
{"cue": 392, "end_ms": 1298620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1296890, "text": "By the way..."}
{"cue": 393, "end_ms": 1302090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298790, "text": "...three of my friends from Sweden"}
{"cue": 394, "end_ms": 1302090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298790, "text": "will be joining us."}
{"cue": 395, "end_ms": 1305320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1302260, "text": "I'm afraid they're not very bright."}
{"cue": 396, "end_ms": 1306990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305500, "text": "I hope you don't mind."}
{"cue": 397, "end_ms": 1311230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309600, "text": "Good."}
{"cue": 398, "end_ms": 1313810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311410, "text": "The hotel address is on the key."}
{"cue": 399, "end_ms": 1318640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313970, "text": "We'll be waiting for you"}
{"cue": 400, "end_ms": 1318640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313970, "text": "in the Marquis de Sade suite."}
{"cue": 401, "end_ms": 1320140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319110, "text": "Bite."}
{"cue": 402, "end_ms": 1325410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322820, "text": "Don't be late..."}
{"cue": 403, "end_ms": 1328490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325590, "text": "...or we'll have to start without you."}
{"cue": 404, "end_ms": 1345570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341700, "text": "Light a candle for me."}
{"cue": 405, "end_ms": 1354240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351650, "text": "Uh, could you give me a hand, please?"}
{"cue": 406, "end_ms": 1358250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356320, "text": "Bravo. Huzzah."}
{"cue": 407, "end_ms": 1363050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1359090, "text": "- No, really. Come on, I'm serious."}
{"cue": 408, "end_ms": 1363050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1359090, "text": "- Come on, gang. Kelp's on me."}
{"cue": 409, "end_ms": 1365560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1363220, "text": "Wait. No, no, no, wait. You wouldn't."}
{"cue": 410, "end_ms": 1368960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1365730, "text": "We would, we want to, we did."}
{"cue": 411, "end_ms": 1371760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1370000, "text": "Flo. Flo."}
{"cue": 412, "end_ms": 1374530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1373300, "text": "Phil. Phil."}
{"cue": 413, "end_ms": 1377190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374700, "text": "Come here, come here, come here."}
{"cue": 414, "end_ms": 1377190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1374700, "text": "Hurry up."}
{"cue": 415, "end_ms": 1379930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377370, "text": "Look, they are waiting."}
{"cue": 416, "end_ms": 1379930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377370, "text": "You have to help me out."}
{"cue": 417, "end_ms": 1382200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380110, "text": "Sure, pal."}
{"cue": 418, "end_ms": 1389280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1386850, "text": "I'll do my best."}
{"cue": 419, "end_ms": 1394220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1392490, "text": "Phil!"}
